    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26208" root="ضيف" body-key="D">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انضاف إِلَيْهِ</span></b>  signifies <i>He,</i> or <i>it, became
joined,</i> or <i>adjoined,</i> or <i>added, to him,</i> or <i>it:</i> and
<i>he joined himself to him:</i> but is perhaps postclassical.]

